","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/sebasbo-autonoma-bcb6047197a3.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"sebasbo/autonoma","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3ed82b547b554504aa33ac28ea4faf17"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_248328965484c7b75c20265f9cea53007130fe8cedd5c88ad1d8ae96c97a1c6e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The package is installed via pip (pip install autonoma) and depends on Pydantic for its data models; the LLM interface itself is supplied by the user."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4221ecd60be8ec4d9c57ad79f86281b776d2e8270a1fab4ea1ff2ffbed058aea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"CoderAgent takes a style_guide parameter defaulting to \"pep8\", and Tester takes a test_framework parameter defaulting to \"unittest\"."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5d438569df69b72944bf874e07f2ef137fd80346e84a9f1e3025d4a69cf15d94"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The system comprises a PlannerAgent that plans tasks from a user query, a CoderAgent that generates/modifies code, a Tester that runs tests, and Pydantic models for entities like Project, Task, and CodeFile."},{"claim_ids":["clm_72676a276af48373f560a2ecedcea3e648312712ffe51f781c0deba9546af864"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The implementation reportedly uses Pydantic for data validation, asynchronous operations for agent coordination, prompt engineering for LLM interaction, and static analysis with AST manipulation for code insights."},{"claim_ids":["clm_73751486865ca7858e0adb4dea85bb2dddfd346d9f37add9f1d028a43a985197"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool targets developers wanting AI-assisted code modification, from small function changes to large-scale refactoring such as adding type hints and Google-style docstrings across a project."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7410540d27bdcb048d5a60131e611a3a4de217344ba48274e6fa8d206bdcca7d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The readme describes a multi-agent system where specialized agents operate asynchronously within an event-driven architecture and collaborate iteratively to generate, refactor, and test code."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9bf4f6f82130e4befdd3154005fcce72c83ca96d35c5157b1a9c79f6435f0337"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Autonoma is described as a Python package that uses AI/language models to analyze and modify codebases, verifying changes through automated testing."},{"claim_ids":["clm_aae15ac1b3656e659e0b0fec5f5aacb89aec83ef984b83fca920b24ca03d3ac5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The readme documents an extensible architecture allowing custom agents and tasks, with a Task model supporting fields like task_type, file_paths, and estimated_complexity."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c7908689fbe2a325c1b33e4967554cf13c9f479b1d4bb0cfac4affe8e1edda6a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Users integrate their own LLM by providing an object with a generate(prompt) -> str method, as shown in the custom LLM integration example."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c7b559dd7f121c2aa37b74ffd2d14074c26dd2acfbebcbad90341591d2195176"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"AutonomaAgent's constructor accepts an LLM interface plus optional PlannerAgent, CoderAgent, and Tester instances, allowing component substitution."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d345e484196bc35510a64c44fb54462db84daf979e2348524d130b75ab355e58"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"AutonomaAgent exposes process_query(query, code_base) returning FinalResult, execute_project(project, code_base) returning ProjectResult, and execute_task(task, agent, codebase) returning TaskResult."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dc76ab563050d627e2f815258cefc0e6a623c43d75ddce3f750be80da0133a15"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors are told to fork the repo, create a branch, write code and tests, ensure all tests pass by running pytest, and submit a pull request, with details in CONTRIBUTING.md."}],"claim_ids":["clm_248328965484c7b75c20265f9cea53007130fe8cedd5c88ad1d8ae96c97a1c6e","clm_4221ecd60be8ec4d9c57ad79f86281b776d2e8270a1fab4ea1ff2ffbed058aea","clm_5d438569df69b72944bf874e07f2ef137fd80346e84a9f1e3025d4a69cf15d94","clm_72676a276af48373f560a2ecedcea3e648312712ffe51f781c0deba9546af864","clm_73751486865ca7858e0adb4dea85bb2dddfd346d9f37add9f1d028a43a985197","clm_7410540d27bdcb048d5a60131e611a3a4de217344ba48274e6fa8d206bdcca7d","clm_9bf4f6f82130e4befdd3154005fcce72c83ca96d35c5157b1a9c79f6435f0337","clm_aae15ac1b3656e659e0b0fec5f5aacb89aec83ef984b83fca920b24ca03d3ac5","clm_c7908689fbe2a325c1b33e4967554cf13c9f479b1d4bb0cfac4affe8e1edda6a","clm_c7b559dd7f121c2aa37b74ffd2d14074c26dd2acfbebcbad90341591d2195176","clm_d345e484196bc35510a64c44fb54462db84daf979e2348524d130b75ab355e58","clm_dc76ab563050d627e2f815258cefc0e6a623c43d75ddce3f750be80da0133a15"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:48Z","created_by_operation":"op_3ed82b547b554504aa33ac28ea4faf17","id":"pg_8cbec3fd74205b9c88e71760532f4068","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/sebasbo-autonoma-readme-md-9e49c95fafe0-1760532f4068.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_e2270b8ae5ce5a38a2ea92b90fca73e1"],"title":"Sebasbo/Autonoma/readme.md @ 9e49c95fafe0","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:48Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3ed82b547b554504aa33ac28ea4faf17"}
